    <main>
      <section class="hero hero-donate">
        <div class="hero-media" role="img" aria-label="Donate to SkillsUSA"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1>Donate to SkillsUSA</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">Support the next generation of skilled professionals</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="donate-intro">
        <div class="intro-content">
          <h2>Make a Difference</h2>
          <p>
            Without the support of our partners, SkillsUSA's vital mission of empowering students to
            become skilled professionals, career-ready leaders and responsible community members
            could never be accomplished. Learn more about the why's and how's of supporting SkillsUSA,
            and help us shape a future we can all be proud of: a future set in skills.
          </p>
          <p>
            Your donation directly supports student competitions, training programs, and leadership
            development opportunities that prepare the next generation for successful careers.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="donation-cta">
        <div class="cta-content">
          <h2>Ready to Make a Difference?</h2>
          <p>
            Your support empowers students to become skilled professionals, leaders, and engaged
            community members. Donate today to help shape the future of our students and our industry.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="cta-button">Get in Touch to Donate</a>
        </div>
    </section>
